---
import SiteShell from "@/layouts/SiteShell.astro";
import { chartCount } from "@/lib/chart-catalog";

const milestones = [
  ["2026.07", "建立数据来源目录与自动更新基线"],
  ["2026.08", "上线市场档案、图表库与来源页面"],
  ["NEXT", "发布可验证的原创市场环境指标"],
] as const;
---

<SiteShell
  bodyClass="about-page"
  description="ArcOfMarket 的缘起、产品原则、数据边界与接下来要做的事。"
  title="关于 · ArcOfMarket"
>
  <main class="about">
    <header class="about-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">ANYWAY.ABOUT · 关于本站</p>
      <h1>不是预测明天，<br />而是看清今天。</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="about-intro">
      <div class="about-story">
        <h2>市场每天都在制造噪音。我们想留下可以复核的坐标。</h2>
        <p>
          ArcOfMarket 从一个很朴素的问题开始：如果一个普通投资者想知道市场到底贵不贵、
          怕不怕、是否过度集中，为什么总要在几十个网站和不同口径之间来回切换？
        </p>
        <p>
          所以这里不做新闻聚合，也不售卖“下一只股票”。我们把长期历史、宏观环境、
          指数结构和原创指标放进同一套出版与审计框架：来源可见、日期可见、方法可见，
          错误和修订也可见。
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="about-facts">
        <div><strong>{chartCount}</strong><span>当前可浏览入口</span></div>
        <div><strong>7</strong><span>研究分类</span></div>
        <div><strong>12</strong><span>行业与专题</span></div>
        <div><strong>0</strong><span>投资建议</span></div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="timeline" aria-labelledby="timeline-title">
      <h2 id="timeline-title">Arc 的时间线</h2>
      <div class="timeline-track">
        {
          milestones.map(([date, text]) => (
            <div>
              <span>{date}</span>
              <i></i>
              <p>{text}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="principles">
      <div class="principles-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">EDITORIAL PRINCIPLES</p>
        <h2>我们把产品价值放在解释、版本与持续性，而不是把公共数据换个包装。</h2>
        <div class="principle-grid">
          <article>
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>事实与观点分开</h3>
            <p>原始事实、计算结果和编辑解释使用不同层级，并保留对应来源。</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>图表与原创读数分开</h3>
            <p>市场图表用于理解事实；原创指标用于解释环境变化和历史位置。</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>时间与口径写清楚</h3>
            <p>图表展示数据日期、来源与计算方法，不把不同频率的数据混在一起。</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>04</span>
            <h3>记录失败样本</h3>
            <p>原创指标不仅展示漂亮回测，也保留信号落点、失败区间和方法修订。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="about-side">
        <h3>产品边界</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>不提供个性化投资建议</li>
          <li>不转售第三方原始行情</li>
          <li>不隐藏数据的有效日期</li>
          <li>不把免责声明当作授权</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/methodology/">方法论与数据政策 →</a>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="about-end">
      <p class="eyebrow">THE ARC CONTINUES</p>
      <h2>一条弧线的意义，不在某个点，而在它连接了哪些时刻。</h2>
      <p>ArcOfMarket 会继续把今天接回历史，把每一次判断留给未来复核。</p>
      <a href="/archive/">进入全部图表 →</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="page-footer">
    <span>© 2026 ArcOfMarket</span><span>·</span>
    <a href="/terms/">服务条款</a><span>·</span>
    <a href="/methodology/">方法论</a>
  </footer>
</SiteShell>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 2rem 2.25rem 0 3rem;
  }

  .about-title {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    min-height: 8.5rem;
  }

  .about-title h1 {
    font-size: 2.05rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
  }

  .about-intro {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.2fr) minmax(16rem, 0.8fr);
  }

  .about-story {
    border-right: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    padding: 3.5rem 3.5rem 3.5rem 0;
  }

  .about-story h2 {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }

  .about-story p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  .about-facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    padding: 3.5rem 0 3.5rem 2rem;
  }

  .about-facts div {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    padding: 0.8rem;
  }

  .about-facts div:nth-child(odd) {
    border-right: 1px dotted var(--rule);
  }

  .about-facts strong,
  .about-facts span {
    display: block;
  }

  .about-facts strong {
    color: var(--main);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .about-facts span {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .timeline {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
  }

  .timeline h2 {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-track {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }

  .timeline-track > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
  }

  .timeline-track span {
    color: var(--main);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    grid-column: 1;
  }

  .timeline-track i {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--main);
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .timeline-track i::before {
    background: var(--main);
    border-radius: 50%;
    content: "";
    height: 0.5rem;
    left: 0;
    position: absolute;
    top: -0.28rem;
    width: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-track p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    max-width: 14rem;
    padding-right: 1rem;
  }

  .principles {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.2fr) minmax(15rem, 0.8fr);
  }

  .principles-copy {
    border-right: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    padding: 4rem 3rem 4rem 0;
  }

  .principles-copy > h2 {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }

  .principle-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .principle-grid article {
    border-top: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    min-height: 11rem;
    padding: 1.3rem 1.3rem 1rem 0;
  }

  .principle-grid article:nth-child(odd) {
    border-right: 1px dotted var(--rule);
  }

  .principle-grid article:nth-child(even) {
    padding-left: 1.3rem;
  }

  .principle-grid span {
    color: var(--main);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .principle-grid h3 {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0.4rem;
  }

  .principle-grid p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
  }

  .about-side {
    padding: 4rem 0 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .about-side ul {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }

  .about-side a,
  .about-end a {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .about-end {
    padding: 5rem 0 6rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-end h2 {
    margin-inline: auto;
    max-width: 45rem;
  }

  .about-end p:not(.eyebrow) {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about {
      padding: 1.3rem 1rem 0;
    }

    .about-title {
      min-height: 8.5rem;
    }

    .about-title h1 {
      font-size: 1.95rem;
    }

    .about-intro,
    .principles {
      display: block;
    }

    .about-story,
    .principles-copy {
      border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
      border-right: 0;
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
    }

    .about-facts {
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }

    .timeline-track {
      display: block;
    }

    .timeline-track > div {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .principle-grid {
      display: block;
    }

    .principle-grid article {
      border-right: 0 !important;
      min-height: 0;
      padding: 1.3rem 0 !important;
    }

    .about-side {
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
